# 🧠 Self-Discovery Engine: Testing & Inputs

The Self-Discovery Engine has been optimized. It now reliably extracts user traits and interests even when using the highly conversational "Texting Realism" mode.

## 🧪 How to Test
1.  Open the **Chat** page.
2.  Select any agent (e.g., **Empathy AI**).
3.  Send one of the **Test Inputs** below.
4.  Wait for the AI response.
5.  You should see a **toast notification** saying *"Self-Discovery Found!"*.
6.  Click **Accept** to add the trait/interest to your profile permanently.

